Wells bends to the open window of Jefferson's car. The two men argue.

4
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Jefferson drives off, leaving Wells standing in the road.

5
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Victoria sits hunched over, her face in her hands.

6
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Victoria lifts her head. Nathan has come to her door.

7
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,000
At the water's edge, Frank rests a hand on his dog.

8
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Candles glow outside the dorm.

9
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Flowers and handwritten messages surround a photograph of Kate.

10
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Chloe sits alone on a bench facing the sea.

11
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Chloe texts Max, 'Sorry about Kate. I hope you're ok. This eclipse freaks me out...'

12
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Max replies, 'Let's find out what's going on! Together!'

13
